IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MULTI-LORA-ROUTER-V13.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-RING-NODES      PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 RINGS-PER-SOCKET    PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 JITTER-NS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-ROUTER-V13.
    IF NUM-RING-NODES == 0 OR RINGS-PER-SOCKET == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 2 TO JITTER-NS.
    MOVE 41800 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-RING-NODES.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
